@startuml
title CrisisSync - Activity Diagram 2: Produce & View SLA Report

' Lane order (left to right)
|Scheduler|
|System Administrator|
|ReportController|
|SLAReportGenerator|

|Scheduler|
start
if (Report trigger?) then ([End of calendar month])
  :Detect end of calendar month;
  :Request SLA report for\nthe month that ended (REQ-21);
else ([Administrator request])
  |System Administrator|
  :Open reports screen;
  |ReportController|
  :Verify authenticated\nSystem Administrator (REQ-30);
  if (Authorized?) then ([Not authorized])
    |System Administrator|
    :Display access denied;
    stop
  else ([Authorized])
  endif
  |System Administrator|
  if (Administrator action?) then ([Generate report])
    repeat
      :Select past reporting month;
      :Request SLA report\n(<= 3 actions - REQ-25, REQ-31);
    backward:Prompt for a completed month (REQ-26);
    repeat while (Selected month has ended?) is ([No]) not ([Yes])
  else ([View existing report])
    |System Administrator|
    :Select stored SLA report\nby reporting month (REQ-27);
    |ReportController|
    :Retrieve stored SLA report;
    |System Administrator|
    :View SLA report table (REQ-27);
    stop
  endif
endif

|ReportController|
:Retrieve report data from DB;

' ===== BEGIN DB-FAILURE =====
while (DB and server available?) is ([Unavailable / timeout])
  group Exception: DB / server unavailable (REQ-29, TEST-06) {
    :Abort generation and log failure;
    fork
      :Send failure alert to\nSystem Administrator;
    fork again
      :Wait until DB and server\nare available again;
    end fork
    :Retry report data retrieval\n(<= 5 min after recovery);
  }
endwhile ([Available])
' ===== END DB-FAILURE =====

|SLAReportGenerator|
:Select events whose last task\nclosed in reporting month (REQ-24);
if (Qualifying events found?) then ([Yes])
  :Compute time from event opening\nto last task closure per event (REQ-23);
  :Group events by event type (REQ-22);
  :Compute average time per event type;
else ([No])
  :Mark "No data" for every event type;
endif
:Build SLA table (event type, average time)\n(<= 30 s for 10,000 events - REQ-28);

|ReportController|
:Store SLA report\nwith generation time;
if (Trigger source?) then ([Scheduled])
  stop
else ([On-demand])
endif

|ReportController|
:Retrieve stored SLA report;
|System Administrator|
:View SLA report table (REQ-27);
stop
@enduml
